    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508970/extras/fbeb8bb19a57ad4366200e1f1e696f55.webp?t=1739215939\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A fast-paced, action-packed top-down shooter blending the chaos of Doom and Hotline Miami with a deep narrative twist.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508970/extras/7154d2da86e49b1492e602166928df59.webp?t=1739215939\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaos of <i>Wake Up Kid</i>, a brutal 2.5D top-down shooter where you control <strong>Bl\u00e1inn</strong>, a mischievous demon banished from Hell. To survive, he strikes a deal with <strong>Timmy</strong>, a bullied kid, helping him fight back\u2014inside the dreamworlds of his tormentors. Blast through surreal nightmares, unleash demonic powers, and uncover a sinister conspiracy hiding deep in the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508970/extras/9d6339713dd81332204d35542bc7f16b.webp?t=1739215939\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong> \u2013 Chain together melee strikes, gunplay, and supernatural abilities in fluid, high-speed battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Dream-Hopping Missions</strong> \u2013 Infiltrate bullies' homes, invade their subconscious, and battle the demons controlling them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Retro-Inspired Visuals</strong> \u2013 PS1/PS2 low-poly models with pixelated textures, giving the game a nostalgic, gritty feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Deep Narrative &amp; Dark Humor</strong> \u2013 A story about bullying, redemption, and demons (both real and metaphorical).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Challenging Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against each bully\u2019s nightmare form before confronting the ultimate evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508970/extras/975ff07f36f77a6c6df90b72bf95401f.webp?t=1739215939\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're launching a <strong>free demo</strong> along with our Steam page, so wishlist <i>Wake Up Kid</i> now and be among the first to experience the madness.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508970/extras/fbeb8bb19a57ad4366200e1f1e696f55.webp?t=1739215939\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A fast-paced, action-packed top-down shooter blending the chaos of Doom and Hotline Miami with a deep narrative twist.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508970/extras/7154d2da86e49b1492e602166928df59.webp?t=1739215939\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaos of <i>Wake Up Kid</i>, a brutal 2.5D top-down shooter where you control <strong>Bl\u00e1inn</strong>, a mischievous demon banished from Hell. To survive, he strikes a deal with <strong>Timmy</strong>, a bullied kid, helping him fight back\u2014inside the dreamworlds of his tormentors. Blast through surreal nightmares, unleash demonic powers, and uncover a sinister conspiracy hiding deep in the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508970/extras/9d6339713dd81332204d35542bc7f16b.webp?t=1739215939\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong> \u2013 Chain together melee strikes, gunplay, and supernatural abilities in fluid, high-speed battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Dream-Hopping Missions</strong> \u2013 Infiltrate bullies' homes, invade their subconscious, and battle the demons controlling them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Retro-Inspired Visuals</strong> \u2013 PS1/PS2 low-poly models with pixelated textures, giving the game a nostalgic, gritty feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Deep Narrative &amp; Dark Humor</strong> \u2013 A story about bullying, redemption, and demons (both real and metaphorical).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Challenging Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against each bully\u2019s nightmare form before confronting the ultimate evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508970/extras/975ff07f36f77a6c6df90b72bf95401f.webp?t=1739215939\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're launching a <strong>free demo</strong> along with our Steam page, so wishlist <i>Wake Up Kid</i> now and be among the first to experience the madness.</p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced 2.5D top-down shooter blending the brutal action of Doom and Hotline Miami. Play as Bl\u00e1inn, a mischievous demon invading nightmares to battle bullies and uncover a dark conspiracy. Shoot, slash, and unleash supernatural powers in surreal dreamscapes.",
